Key Benefits of EventBridge
Serverless

There is no server to manage for the event-routing layer.

Event-driven

Applications can react automatically when something happens.

Scheduling

Tasks can be executed on a defined schedule.

Automation

It reduces manual operational work.

Integration

It can connect AWS services, custom applications, and supported third-party sources.

Loose coupling

The event producer does not need to directly know how the consumer will process the event.

For example:

EC2 → EventBridge → Lambda

EC2 doesn't need to directly communicate with Lambda.